    {
      "name": "Pregunta frecuente",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "pregunta",
      "description": "details/summary con signo + que gira a − al abrir; filete inferior.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-pregunta\"><summary><span class=\"ds-pregunta-texto\">¿Cuánto cuesta el servicio?</span><span class=\"ds-signo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Depende de cada situación. Consultanos por tu caso.</p></details>",
      "css": ".ds-pregunta{border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-rule,#D6D8CD);font-family:Archivo,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--color-ink,#202723);}.ds-pregunta summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:1.5rem;min-height:3.5rem;padding:1.25rem 0;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;}.ds-pregunta summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}.ds-pregunta-texto{font-size:1.1875rem;line-height:1.375;font-weight:600;text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:4px;}.ds-pregunta summary:hover .ds-pregunta-texto{text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--color-oxide,#A1442F);}.ds-pregunta summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-oxide,#A1442F);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-signo{position:relative;flex-shrink:0;width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;margin-top:0.25rem;}.ds-signo::before,.ds-signo::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;background:currentColor;}.ds-signo::before{left:0;right:0;top:50%;height:2px;transform:translateY(-50%);}.ds-signo::after{top:0;bottom:0;left:50%;width:2px;transform:translateX(-50%);transition:transform 200ms cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1);}.ds-pregunta[open] .ds-signo::after{transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(90deg);}.ds-pregunta p{margin:0;padding-bottom:1.5rem;max-width:60ch;color:var(--color-muted,#60665B);}"
